git push origin new-feature

In the Jenkins user interface, navigate to the sample-app job:

Click Dashboard (or the Jenkins logo in the top left).
Click sample-app.
If the new-feature branch does not appear immediately under the Branches tab, click Scan Multibranch Pipeline Now in the left sidebar.
Click the new-feature branch link.

In the Build History section on the left, click the build number (for example, #1), then click Console Output in the left sidebar to view the live build logs.

Track the output of the build and watch for the kubectl --namespace=new-feature apply... messages. Once completed, your new-feature branch is deployed to your cluster.

